      "id": 91756,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-16T13:52:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Silverleaf\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/48/2332_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Silverleaf:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Ronway wrote:</b><br><blockquote>That looks like it takes way too much work. I will start a petition to have a button added on the bottom right of every post. It will say \"quote\", note that it will not be capital, because capitals are lame!&nbsp;Edit: Anyone that wishes to have a \"quote\" button added, click the link below and put your username on it. We must have this feature, it'll end the confusion of what people are responding to!&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IOG_pnWNOHqTK8hDw6PhoUtLAckuJTpuVqZI4RwoF5s/edit\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IOG_pnWNOHqTK8hDw6PhoUtLAckuJTpuVqZI...</a>\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI disagree. I'd never use a feature like that. If you want a quote button then you're as bad as a Nazi.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Nazi's? &nbsp;Did this just become the history channel?</p>\n<p>I suggest that you all consider the possibilities that ancient peoples had quote buttons because of Aliens. &nbsp;That's why Nazi's wanted them.</p>",
